# Available Metrics

<!-- THIS FILE MUST NOT BE EDITED BY HAND -->
<!-- ON NEW METRIC ADDED PLEASE RUN 'make generate-metrics-documentation' -->
<!-- markdownlint-disable MD013 -->

All metrics available for scraping are exposed on the {{backtick 1}}/metrics{{backtick 1}} endpoint.
The metrics are in the Prometheus exposition format.

To access the metrics:

{{backtick 3}}sh
curl http://localhost:9115/metrics
{{backtick 3}}

## Supported Metrics

> Probe-specific metrics are only present in the response of the {{backtick 1}}/probe{{backtick 1}} endpoint, not on {{backtick 1}}/metrics{{backtick 1}}.
> The **Prober** column shows which probe type(s) expose the metric: {{backtick 1}}all{{backtick 1}} means every prober, {{backtick 1}}-{{backtick 1}} means it is a global metric.

